The overlay window is created and configured to be transparent, frameless, and always on top. It loads an HTML page from a local server. Event handlers are set for closing the overlay. Functions are defined to open, close and apply the selected location from the IPC events. Upon location selection, the main window's bounds are updated to reflect the new position, and focus is returned to the main window.

